# Rates and menus from data

- Room rates, seasons, menus, tax: read from DB/ERP settings — never bake into components.
- Public CMS content resolves by Host / property slug, not hard-coded Pelbu copy.
- Seed data belongs in migrations or admin tools, not duplicated in React constants (except demo fixtures clearly marked).
